    "body": "As mentioned in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34644#discussion_r2889315162 and https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35675#discussion_r360301816, the validation state catchers were defined in the block template manager, `submitblock` rpc and mining test helpers, even though they do the same thing.\r\n\r\nMoved this helper into `node/block_validation_state_catcher.h` and reuse it across all three callers. An optional validation state replaces the separate `found` flag where used, preserving each caller's registration and result handling",
